COMMENT ON COLUMN rulebook_tools.href IS 'Where its link goes; ''editor'' means this form''s running rulebook editor.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN rulebook_tools.link_text IS 'The link''s text.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN rulebook_tools.sort_order IS 'Position in the panel.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN rulebook_tools.form IS 'Which form of the rulebook the tool is about: ontology (things, properties, statements) or concept (tables).';

